# ROVEXO My Account Master Template v1.0 (PERMANENT LOCK)

**STATUS: APPROVED | PERMANENT LOCK | PRODUCTION GATE**

SSOT: `lib/design-system/my-account-v1.ts`  
Template: `features/account-canonical/MyAccountTemplate.tsx`

## Golden rule

**Forbidden:** building My Account pages with private design systems.

```
PROFILE → MyAccountTemplate → Header/Spacing/Button/Card/Typography/Responsive/Full Width engines → MY ACCOUNT v1.0
```

## Rules #22–#28

| # | Rule |
|---|------|
| 22 | Master Template Engine — one template for all My Account pages |
| 23 | Inheritance Lock — Settings/Addresses/Account Details/Security/Verification/… inherit `MyAccountTemplate` |
| 24 | One Change Rule — Profile token change updates all pages automatically |
| 25 | Design Lock — identical padding/height/radius/width; only CONTENT may differ |
| 26 | Master Component Lock — header/title/section/button/card/arrow/divider/spacing/footer via template |
| 27 | Production Gate — private padding/spacing/header/buttons/components/proportions → REJECTED (no UI LOCK / Freeze / Certification / Production) |
| 28 | Future Proof — Subscription / AI Settings / Wallet Settings / etc. inherit template; never build individually |

## Forbidden private pages

Addresses · Security · Verification · Currency · Privacy · Notifications · AccountDetails · Settings — must not ship their own design system.

## Required pattern

```tsx
import { MyAccountTemplate } from "@/features/account-canonical";

export function ExamplePage() {
  return (
    <MyAccountTemplate surface="settings" title="Settings" backHref="/account" showHeaderTitle>
      {/* CONTENT ONLY */}
    </MyAccountTemplate>
  );
}
```

## Cursor must never

- Create page-local headers, paddings, button heights, radii, or widths for My Account
- Duplicate design systems per Settings subpage
- Skip `MyAccountTemplate` for listed inheritance pages

## Master Page Lock

See `.cursor/rules/my-account-master-page-lock-v1.mdc` — PROFILE PAGE is the permanent master for icons, colours, components, spacing, typography, proportions, and full width.
